## Model card

- **Name:** Claude Mythos 5 (Anthropic)
- **Short description:** Anthropic's Claude Mythos 5, documented by Anthropic as the same model as Claude Fable 5 but available only to organizations verified through Anthropic's verification programs. Frontier reasoning model for demanding reasoning and cybersecurity/biology-related defensive work (per Anthropic positioning). Legacy relative to newer Mythos releases.
- **Provider / access:** Claude API (`claude-mythos-5`), Amazon Bedrock (`anthropic.claude-mythos-5`), Claude Models on Google Cloud (Google managed, `claude-mythos-5`), Microsoft Foundry (`claude-mythos-5`) — verification required per Anthropic.
- **Release / knowledge:** Released 2026-06-09 (per Anthropic docs). Reliable knowledge cutoff January 2026; training data cutoff January 2026 (per Anthropic docs).
- **IDs:** `claude-mythos-5` (Claude API and listed platforms), `anthropic.claude-mythos-5` (Bedrock).
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 tokens; max output 128K tokens (per Anthropic docs).
- **Modalities:** Text and image input; text output. Reasoning: adaptive (always on). Tool use supported.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $10.00 / 1M input tokens, $50.00 / 1M output tokens (same as Claude Fable 5, per Anthropic docs). Cache and batch pricing available. Paid, premium pricing.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary (parameter count and detailed architecture not publicly disclosed). Anthropic states Mythos 5 has the same specifications and pricing as Claude Fable 5.

